                "loc": "NUM.28.16+NUM.28.17+NUM.28.18+NUM.28.19+NUM.28.20+NUM.28.21+NUM.28.22+NUM.28.23+NUM.28.24+NUM.28.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 28:16–25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa waenderera kuaambira Aiziraeli, “Sherekeyani Pasaka ili kuishimu Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu mwezi wa Abibu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mwezi wa",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Abibu",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ni mwezi wa Chieburania ambao unagbwa sawa na mwezi wa hahu au wa ne kahi za kalenda zehu za siku hizi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mana katika mwezi hinyo, Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu wakutuluzani Misiri wakati wa usiku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lavyani sadaka ya Pasaka kula mifugo yenu ya mangʼondzi au ngʼombe phatu pha ibada ambapho Mwenyezi Mlungu andaphatsambula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msirye sadaka iyo na mikahe iriyotiywa hamira. Ryani mikahe isiyotiywa hamira kpwa muda wa siku sabaa ambayo ni ishara ya mateso, kpwa sababu mwahenda wangbwi kutuluka Misiri. Kpwa hivyo, hendani hivi ili mtambukire hira siku mriphotuluka Misiri muda wosi ndioishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa muda wa siku sabaa kusionekane hamira kpwenye tsi yenu yosi, na nyama ya ye nyama yetsindzwa dziloni ra siku ya kpwandza isisale hadi ligundzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msilavye sadaka ya Pasaka kpwenye mudzi wowosi ambao Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, andakuphani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela ni muilavye phatu pha ibada ambapho Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, andaphatsambula. Mlavireni sadaka ya Pasaka wakati wa dziloni, dzuwa rinaphotswa, wakati dza hura mriphotuluka Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jitani yo nyama na muirye phatu hipho Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu ndiphotsambula. Ligundzure mundagaluka na kuuya kpwenye mahema genu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa muda wa siku sita mundarya mikahe isiyotiywa hamira. Siku ya sabaa ni muhende mkpwutano mkpwulu wa kuabudu Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu na msihende kazi za kawaida siku hiyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
